1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,640
But that howl might also
break through—

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,960
and reach inside you.

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,680
I give up.

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,960
Not necessarily a howl.

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,880
But there is a kind of pain in you—

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:14,960
a pain that can’t be expressed.

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,400
Intense pain.
